[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Aether Disk Usage
Name[ar]=استخدام القرص لأيثر
GenericName=Disk Usage Analyzer
GenericName[ar]=محلل استخدام القرص
Comment=Inspect folder sizes and find large files on disk
